  "unchanged_policy_and_allocation_invariants": [
    "Exactly five original prescribed budget-complete members in canonical order; only the explicitly approved product PPO/mountain-car150->300 allocation changes from Source8af. No dropping, replacement, imputation, score-seeking retries or extensions beyond the frozen allocation; further evidence-led investigation if it fails is separately authorized.",
    "At least three SAME original members jointly satisfy authentic actual-own-initial strict improvement and every task signal/reference predicate.",
    "All five outcomes, including finite below-bar/non-improving members, remain in the unchanged whole-five historical quality statistic.",
    "Original served index0 independently satisfies its own exact learning/reference and unchanged external/historical bar restrictions; no outcome-selected serving index.",
    "Exact admitted served bytes, original source/device provenance, authentic replay, completion, Store and lane admission remain mandatory.",
    "Historical calibrated-floor provenance remains explicitly limited; finite canonical learning does not claim population probability or published-model parity.",
    "All43 native rows retain original seeds42..46, all38 RETURN/1 HER/4 AlphaZero conditions and authentic physical work/reference schedules. Only PPO/mountain-car allocates300iterations*512steps*16envs=2457600transitions perseed/12288000wholefive; the other42native allocations, served0/model/optimizer/reset/evaluation/bars and device provenance remain fixed.",
    "RETURN keeps exact paired own-initial strict gain; reference equality is allowed only at the independently proved current task maximum. HER keeps both original goal/success predicates; arena keeps both roles and the policy-independent tape."
  ],
