ly no new CPU55 scientific result, qualified outcome, replay/Store/journal/admission or phase completion. CPU55 has not started.\",\n    \"Seen-benchmark adaptivity, no proven cause or guarantee, original Source8af/CFA/other failed attempts, literal wrapper count mismatch and caller warning remain retained; further evidence-led investigation if the approved trial fails is authorized.\",\n    \"This draft is not a Root or peer approval. Do not materialize until both independent assessments cover the exact generated bytes.\",\n    \"Actual public export supplies source/contract DATA only; it does not prove the linked library origin, reviewer independence, hardware, learning, Store admission, journal or phase completion.\"\n  ]\n}\n",
