0->300 schedule arithmetic checked2457600/seed and12288000 wholefive; sourcebudget pinned5d33151e unchanged.\",\n  \"mathematical_source_checks\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/Product/SupervisedQualificationPolicy.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"179-242,260-308\",\n      \"finding\": \"Orderedfive; planned counters; same-originaljoint>=3; fullfive median; served0 ownfindings.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/Product/LearningSignal.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"20-58,76-125\",\n      \"finding\": \"Exact majority/uniform controls, strict count/SSE owninitial and best-heldout-constant comparison; probability limits.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/Product/NativeReturnLearningPolicy.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"125-211\",\n      \"finding\": \"Complete references; five42+index; same-originaljoint; fullfive quality; served0; maximum-onlyreference equality.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/RL/NativeReturnCeiling.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"85-115\",\n      \"finding\": \"Complete current canonical proof onlyKeyDoor; no mountain-car tie exception.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/RL/ConvergenceThresholds.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"102-104,139\",\n      \"finding\": \"PPOmountain-car unchanged>=-155.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/Product/NativeHerLearningPolicy.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"53-55,195-305,312-349,516-526\",\n      \"finding\": \"Joint success/distance gains; exhaustive reference validation; wholefive andserved0.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/Product/NativeArenaLearningPolicy.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"88-98,462-548,585-604\",\n      \"finding\": \"ExactWDL; maximum1onlyties; strictgain+allrefs joint; bothwholefive criteria andserved0.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"src/JitML/SL/ConvergenceThresholds.hs\",\n      \"line_references\": \"69-91\",\n      \"finding\": \"Compact historical floors and explicit Tiny calibration limit.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fresh_integer_binomial_arithmetic\": {\n    \"n\": 1000,\n    \"alpha_denominator\": 5000,\n    \"critical_counts\": {\n      \"classes10\": 136,\n      \"classes100\": 24,\n      \"classes200\": 16\n    },\n    \"all_chosen_tail_inequalities_and_predecessor_inequalities_checked\": true,\n    \"formula\": \"sum(j=k..n,C(n,j)*(classes-1)^(n-j))*5000 <= classes^n; critical k is first satisfying integer.\"\n  },\n  \"limits\": [\n    \"Prospective finite criterion applicability only; no implementation defect, success cause, convergence assurance, unseen-heldout confirmation or population claim.\",\n    \"No model/checkpoint/tensor/dataset/journal.key payload access, source/canonical mutation, scientific execution, helper/preparer/compiler/test/runtime/Docker action or git stage/commit/push. Only this fresh ignored assessment FILE is written.\",\n    \"Authentic original physical work, selected lane/device provenance, initialization/final identity, full55 qualification/replay/Store/journal and admission remain actual execution obligations.\",\n    \"Unchanged assembler10457/d44e0e48 schema read statically; not executed. Later exact final assembly consistency is separate from this draft assessment.\"\n  ]\n}\n",
