        "new_qualified_outcomes": 0,
        "rationale": [
          "I approve prospective applicability of this unchanged finite quality criterion to this exact scope. The human-approved canonical product PPO/mountain-car allocation changes150->300 iterations; the entire recipe is not unchanged. Quality floors, reference policies, strict initial-gain rules and every other allocation remain fixed. The longer schedule is an experimental allocation, not a demonstrated mechanical repair or convergence guarantee.",
          "Exactly five original prescribed members must actually complete the frozen budget in original order. At least three SAME original members jointly satisfy authentic strict own-initial improvement and every applicable signal/reference predicate. Whole-five unchanged quality statistics retain all finite failures. Original served index0 independently satisfies its own learning/reference/quality, source/device/work/completion, exact-artifact Store admission and replay requirements.",
          "No seed replacement, score filtering, imputation, best-checkpoint selection, row/cohort splice, automatic retry or further budget extension is authorized. Further evidence-led investigation if this one approved trial fails is authorized, with original failures and all started attempts retained.",
          "Both current ordered55 vectors join the actual selected-package helper export: only the two PPO/mountain-car PlanIds change from Source8af, all110 report digests and108other whole objects remain exact. Eleven unchanged historical C2 policy source FILE pins are independently checked as FILEs, not a nonexistent exported projection vector. Current606 source raw pins match the frozen snapshot.",
          "The recorded native build, selected-package compile and actual library joins are provenance evidence, distinct from scientific execution. My separate12657-byte independent review gives full compile/stream/binary/31-input/export/private-ID joins. The direct GHC command uses explicit package IDs, cleared source search and no-isrc fallback. The current repo-local plan/conf/static+dylib/local-package-cache/CLI/helper FILE pins were also rechecked in this assessment.",
          "All historical C2/8af/605/9b primaries/support and failed attempts retain their original source, scope and outcomes. Backend engineering passes do not qualify rows; the full-unit failure, firstCFA85/86 failure, expected7/actual10 wrapper failure and inherited caller partial-head warning532bytes remain literal. Current final native engineering86/10/1/30 is technical evidence only.",
          "This approves prospective review DATA, with zero current qualified outcomes. It provides no CPU55/Apple55 scientific result, model or producer origin, replay/Store admission, source journal, lane registration or phase completion. Actual complete current-source CPU55 qualification/admission and subsequent genuine Apple55 are separate obligations.",
          "All43 native rows retain38 RETURN/1 HER/4 arena predicates and training seeds42..46. Only canonical product PPO/mountain-car becomes300*512*16=2457600 scheduled transitions per seed/12288000 wholefive; ordinary planning remains150 and other42 native allocations stay fixed. All five must actually complete the new schedule; declaration, early quality passage or a partial scope does not suffice.",
          "RETURN retains strict exact-rational final episode-return-median gain over authentic own initial, jointly with every prescribed task reference. Equality against a reference requires an actually attained independently proved current structural maximum; current ceiling proof is KeyDoor-only, so mountain-car retains strict reference comparisons. PPO/mountain-car whole-five legacy median AND independently eligible original served0 require >=(-110-45)=-155. These quality checks do not replace same-original3joint successes.",
          "HER requires strict own success-count gain AND strict exact mean-distance improvement, jointly with both exhaustive6^6 reference extrema over the fixed20 goal cases. Reference equality is limited to proved structural20successes/exact0distance. All five remain in both unchanged legacy quality reducers, and served0 independently meets own joint/bothbars.",
          "Arena retains policy-independent addressed tape/cases, both roles, exact(2W+D)/18, strict own-initial gain and both fixed uniform/neutral-MCTS references. Reference equality is allowed only if that actual reference and final both attain structural score1, requiring ninewins; historical saturation does not prove future current attainment. Both unchanged quality reducers and originalserved0 restrictions remain.",
          "SAC effective-initial warm preparation and ARS actual hostDouble/applied-step lineage remain source-literal; neither fake device fixtures nor an MLP/GPU surrogate can replace host ARS provenance. Separate tuning remains seed1729/trials128 optimization, with no five-seed native-learning claim. Compact native tasks/floors supply no population confidence, published recipe replication or attainability guarantee."
        ],
        "lane_limit": "Actual new-source hostMetal work and complete lane evidence remain required, with expressly scoped host ARS provenance. NativeMetal30 does not qualify55rows."
